#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:10
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "Hatókör"

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:12
msgid ""
"This chunk covers 15 live-application modules, 5,606 lines and 47,051 "
"measured proxy tokens. All nine bounded pages were read in full. It "
"includes registry-selected filed-source capture, IVA wallet/history "
"acquisition and reads, encrypted justificante snapshots and verification,"
" plus read-gated notification-document custody and result projections. "
"Static only: no AEAT session, receipt, notification PDF, browser, "
"operation host, repository, or test was executed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:14
msgid "IVA and source-dependency capture"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:16
msgid ""
"The filed-source operation accepts one target model/year/period, pins the"
" registry authority in its worker, and delegates source dependency "
"selection to the model revision. It downloads outside local commit "
"fences, then guards each local write and publishes a complete summary of "
"captured observations, artefacts, justificantes, filing reconciliation, "
"and calculation-history keys. It is exact-profile and whole-profile "
"COMMIT access because registry dependencies can cross periods. Source-"
"capture executor and access "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/filed_source_capture_operation.py`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:18
msgid ""
"IVA remote-state orchestration holds a profile storage span, enforces a "
"matching target-year/period, and reads the AEAT IVA compensation history "
"and current wallet through one composed port. Authentication failure "
"becomes an acquisition report with two non-success surface outcomes and a"
" persisted manifest; with a session, filed history and wallet are "
"attempted and classified independently under separate timeouts. If a "
"surface fails after a guarded local write began, the exception propagates"
" rather than being represented as a clean failed read. The final "
"acquisition manifest records auth and surface status, outcome/failure "
"modes, captured counts, selected wallet authority, divergence and "
"blocking state, with a digest-derived identity. This gives later readers "
"a record of attempts as well as successful values. Combined acquisition "
"and independent outcomes "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/iva_remote_state.py`) Failure isolation "
"and manifest persistence "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/iva_remote_state.py`) Manifest identity "
"and surface facts (`src/cadrumo/application/live/iva_remote_state.py`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:20
msgid ""
"Separate operations expose a wallet capture, historical filed-IVA "
"capture, and local IVA history query. Wallet capture is period-scoped and"
" reports exact amounts and authority/divergence state; history spans the "
"profile and returns rows, carry-forward lots, provenance, source "
"observation keys, and saved authority decisions. Capture summaries omit "
"private history rows, while the local history projection is closed and "
"validates its row counts. Wallet request/result "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/iva_wallet_capture_operation.py`) Wallet-"
"history capture result "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/iva_wallet_history_capture_operation.py`) "
"Profile-bound history projection "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/iva_wallet_history_operation.py`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:22
msgid ""
"These remote acquisition projectors discard their terminal receipt before"
" projecting the result. The same pattern appears in the source-capture "
"projector and combined IVA/wallet capture projectors. Executors do bind "
"profile, scope, and effects, but this chunk does not establish whether "
"the operation host restricts projector invocation to the matching "
"successful receipt; verify that framework contract. By contrast, the "
"justificante and notification-document projectors in this same range "
"enforce receipt identity/effect directly. IVA report projector "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/iva_remote_state_capture_operation.py`) "
"Wallet projector "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/iva_wallet_capture_operation.py`) History-"
"capture projector "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/iva_wallet_history_capture_operation.py`) "
"Source-capture projector "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/filed_source_capture_operation.py`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:24
msgid "Justificante custody and evidence matching"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:26
msgid ""
"Justificante capture resolves the correct expediente through the period-"
"bearing declarations register, preferring an accepted `ALTA` row and then"
" the latest presentation; it refuses when no matching declaration or "
"procedure-tree entry exists rather than falling back to a different "
"period. Snapshots bind model/year/period, expediente, CSV, raw-PDF digest"
" and PDF bytes encoded inside the encrypted snapshot envelope. The "
"content-addressed ID makes an identical receipt idempotent, while a new "
"PDF on the same filing axis supersedes the prior active snapshot. "
"Snapshot validation re-decodes the PDF and checks its digest. Period-to-"
"expediente resolution (`src/cadrumo/application/live/justificante.py`) "
"Snapshot integrity and content identity "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/justificante.py`) Lifecycle and secure "
"repository (`src/cadrumo/application/live/justificante.py`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:28
msgid ""
"Authenticity is a four-state advisory (`NOT_CHECKED`, `CONFIRMED`, "
"`DENIED`, `UNAVAILABLE`), not a boolean: an incomplete cotejo round trip "
"is not reported as AEAT denial. The captured receipt is retained even "
"when cotejo is unavailable. Parsed metadata is registered only after its "
"CSV matches the capture and its model/year/period axis agrees. Filing-"
"evidence stamping additionally loads the current local filing, resolves "
"expected taxpayer identity from the record or profile, requires the "
"receipt to match that record, refuses to overwrite evidence for a "
"different CSV, then reconciles and verifies that the persisted record is "
"accepted. This separates receipt custody, receipt parsing, and filing "
"confirmation. Authenticity states and verification "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/justificante.py`) CSV/axis checks and "
"metadata registration (`src/cadrumo/application/live/justificante.py`) "
"Filing-record match and reconciliation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/justificante.py`) Cotejo persistence "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/justificante.py`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:30
msgid ""
"The recorded capture wraps each local write in a fresh fence, owns "
"browser cleanup, verifies the returned snapshot still matches "
"profile/model/year/period, and publishes a compact result without the PDF"
" bytes. Its result projector requires exact definition/subject, "
"successful condition, updated effect, and a result reference. Local "
"list/show operations run without a browser, revalidate the bucket, and "
"return allowlisted metadata only; show never returns the stored PDF body."
" Justificante operation effects and receipt "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/justificante_capture_operation.py`) "
"Profile-bound capture flow "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/justificante_capture_operation.py`) "
"Metadata-only list/show projections "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/justificante_read_operation.py`) Read "
"receipt validation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/justificante_read_operation.py`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:32
msgid "Notification-document custody and reads"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:34
msgid ""
"Notification custody requires an injected content guard before work and "
"again before the Sede fetch; the adapter fetch contract also requires its"
" own read-state check before bytes cross the wire. Fetched bytes stay in "
"memory until written to the encrypted, content-addressed attachment "
"store; the separate encrypted record binds the attachment digest, "
"certificate ID, byte size, source URL, and parsed result or refusal. One "
"certificate has one record. Re-fetching identical content is an explicit "
"no-op; a disagreement in bucket, digest, size, or source URL refuses "
"instead of replacing stored evidence. The record validator requires "
"exactly one of a parsed sanction/liquidation or a parse refusal, so "
"unreadable content cannot look like zeroed financial data. Record and "
"reading/refusal invariants "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/notification_documents.py`) Idempotent "
"custody and conflict checks "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/notification_documents.py`) Encrypted in-"
"memory persistence path "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/notification_documents.py`) Read-gated "
"fetch (`src/cadrumo/application/live/notification_documents.py`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:36
msgid ""
"The capture operation is exact-profile, owns the browser process, fences "
"custody, and expects `NONE` for an already-held document or `UPDATED` for"
" new custody. It publishes no PDF bytes. Local view returns allowlisted "
"metadata, an optional parsed sanction with decimal values preserved as "
"strings, or the explicit parse refusal; history returns only parsed "
"readings. These result models tie sanction/certificate/digest identities "
"and counts together. View disclosure is profile and tax data; history "
"disclosure is tax data. Both registered readers validate a successful, "
"no-effect receipt. Notification capture receipt and outcome "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/notification_document_capture_operation.py`)"
" Read result and refusal shape "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/notification_document_read_operation.py`) "
"Receipt-checked view/history results "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/notification_document_read_operation.py`) "
"Purpose-specific read disclosures "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/notification_document_read_operation.py`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:38
msgid "Assessment and follow-up"
msgstr "Értékelés és további vizsgálatok"

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:40
msgid ""
"The clearest strength is evidence matching at each boundary: model/period"
" before receipt selection, independent CSV and filing identity before "
"justificante stamping, certificate identity before document custody, and "
"a visible reading refusal when a notification document cannot be parsed. "
"Raw documents stay in encrypted stores and public schemas expose metadata"
" or structured readings rather than PDF bytes. The primary cross-module "
"follow-up is receipt enforcement for the IVA/source result projectors; "
"resolve it against the operation host before assigning reachability or "
"severity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-surfaces.md:42
msgid ""
"One additional event-loop invariant deserves confirmation. Combined IVA "
"acquisition installs a filter for two known Playwright shutdown messages "
"and calls that context with `restore_on_exit=effect_guard is not None`; "
"without an effect guard, the prior loop handler is not restored on exit. "
"This may be intentional to absorb delayed cancellation noise, but the "
"call can affect later code on the same event loop and should be checked "
"against the lifecycle of direct callers. Document/attachment and PDF "
"snapshot writes are also separate local persistence steps; interruption "
"can leave an unreferenced content-addressed attachment or orphan receipt,"
" though the inspected code avoids writing a record that points to missing"
" bytes. No tests were reviewed or run, and the provider adapters, storage"
" transactions, host receipt dispatch, and frontend policy were not "
"exercised."
msgstr ""

